VENDORED LIBRARY
================
Name:       Docling
Version:    2.x (vendored snapshot)
Upstream:   https://github.com/DS4SD/docling
License:    MIT (see LICENSE)

Purpose:
  Provides document conversion (PDF, DOCX, images) to structured
  output for Aether's document processing pipeline.  Vendored to
  integrate Aether's custom OCR backends (GLM-OCR, PaddleOCR) and
  VLM pipeline configurations without forking upstream.

Modification policy:
  - Aether integrates via docling_api_server.py (the wrapper).
  - The docling/ package directory is upstream code.
  - TODO/FIXME/HACK comments inside docling/ are upstream issues,
    NOT Aether technical debt.
  - Custom backends live in core/integrations/libraries/ocr/.
